			"notes": "- Added Fabric builds for every Minecraft version already supported by NeoForge, including 1.21.2, 1.21.3, 1.21.5, 1.21.11, 26.2, and 26.3; also added NeoForge builds for 26.2 and 26.3.\n- Tooltips now identify the mod behind each binding, with matching formatting in Key Binds and Keyboard View.\n- Bindings appear on separate lines by default; compact tooltips are available in the config.\n- Ignored bindings appear in their own section at the end of the tooltip.\n- Shortcut labels show only additional keys, and the hovered binding's modifier is visible.\n- Tooltips follow the cursor, stay above other controls, adapt to GUI scale and window size, and scroll when needed.\n- Tooltips hide during rebinding and return after leaving and hovering over the button again.\n- Improved keyboard centering, section spacing, mouse-button labels, and international-key names.\n- Fixed Controlling dropdown overlap and stuck modifier-only rebinding on affected NeoForge versions.\n- Added optional Simple Mode and individual switches for ignore controls, groups, and width adjustments.\n- GitHub releases now collect every supported build under one mod version.\n- Keyboard View controls wrap into balanced rows at high GUI scales; tall keyboards scroll instead of shrinking labels into dots.\n- Keybind tooltips switch immediately between rows without flickering across small gaps.\n- Group and Ignore buttons are smaller, with full-size centered letters.\n- Vanilla Debug shortcuts are ignored for conflict checks by default, with persistent individual and section overrides.\n- Added section-wide Ignore and Group buttons, including Add all/Remove all in the group picker.\n- Aligned Rules and Groups screen headers, subtitles, backgrounds, and footer boundaries.\n- Removed decorative conflict bars while retaining conflict colors and tooltip details.\n- Added showControlsRowButtons to hide row and section controls without disabling their features.\n- Added short config hints and a separate features section, with automatic migration of existing settings.\n- Fixed member-list scrolling and scrollbar dragging in large groups across versions.\n- Fixed duplicate Keyboard View and Width buttons after resizing the controls screen.\n\n\n## Included builds\n\n- fabric-1.20.1 (`5833ea7ef82fcb19261d44ab44e3032e95b1a5a2`)\n- fabric-1.21.1 (`0b8d195d8e04bcfce433e1172d62e53b484c661e`)\n- fabric-1.21.2 (`0f243e7044a6084ced7e0888cffdd6805ca0782e`)\n- fabric-1.21.3 (`a464b12a8f295fe14f5bedd71db5e2334b05a31d`)\n- fabric-1.21.5 (`36060444f10edf720fceab2c988834cb6278dd3d`)\n- fabric-1.21.11 (`5bb6fcca5edff980024faf95877f5aad7048be6c`)\n- fabric-26.1.2 (`68fb5b856c7d2c916156febd1be0aadee1a19112`)\n- fabric-26.2 (`515167163d80b8e0f8f6f5c8331dbc87fa78ba7b`)\n- fabric-26.3 (`ed1774cd825765ac719aabf894b51596cb9cd12c`)\n- forge-1.20.1 (`c1e589227cb62830e1f73ffa9c1ce7565bb4132a`)\n- neoforge-1.20.1 (`96baa82f8a0674a1d1bca0d71c50aa81e58e52dc`)\n- neoforge-1.21.1-1.21.3 (`05dd29e04a03edecbb6cec85de1af27be6633c2f`)\n- neoforge-1.21.5 (`4d0c3baf71e3cc81e3adf2d80b55c0b6f70714be`)\n- neoforge-1.21.11 (`7e3ca9f975dd837b8ad0d6a2b9c0928a20e782c5`)\n- neoforge-26.1.2 (`8027bb4e3d2f7ac26de0a1e4dd07d33c21a3cb6a`)\n- neoforge-26.2 (`837acbe12c1e9819f664bd3d8a6d2da8f7513b4c`)\n- neoforge-26.3 (`98020ef18273045bbd9d11b592d29c6088b50e6d`)"
